 "stimulus_html": "Use the figure to answer the following exercises. Identify the graph or graphs with the given characteristic.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/4dd216fc459cbd45.png\" alt=\"Four graphs. Graph 9 has six vertices: i, j, k, m, n, and o. All the vertices are interconnected. Graph 10 has 7 vertices: t, w, y u, v, x, and z. The edges connect t w, w y, v x, x z, u w, u x, and x y. Graph 11 has 8 vertices: a, b, c, d, e, f, g, and h. The edges connect a b, b c, c d, d e, e f, f g, g h, and h a. Graph 11 has 9 vertices: p, q, r, s, t, u, v, w, and x. The edges connect p q, q r, r u, u x, x w, w v, v s, s p, p t, t x, r t, t v, s t, t u, q t, and t w.\">\n\n",
